KDE Frameworks components bundled with QElectroTech
=====================================================

QElectroTech includes a minimal subset of the following KDE Frameworks
libraries when the bundled minimal KF build is selected:

  - KCoreAddons
  - KWidgetsAddons

The KDE-derived source files retain their original copyright and licensing
notices. Unless a file states otherwise, those files are licensed under the
GNU Library General Public License, version 2, or any later version
(LGPL-2.0-or-later). The complete license text is provided in
licenses/KDE-Frameworks.LICENSE.

The bundled code is derived from KDE Frameworks, an independent project:

  https://kde.org/
  https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/kcoreaddons
  https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/kwidgetsaddons

The component-specific source provenance and file lists are documented in:

  thirdparty/kcoreaddons/KDE-Frameworks.PROVENANCE
  thirdparty/kwidgetsaddons/KDE-Frameworks.PROVENANCE

Not all files in the thirdparty/kcoreaddons and thirdparty/kwidgetsaddons
directories are part of KDE Frameworks. Files carrying a QElectroTech
copyright/license header, including local build files, wrapper headers, and
replacement support headers, were added by QElectroTech and are not KDE
Frameworks library files. Those files are licensed under the QElectroTech
license stated in the files and in the top-level LICENSE file.

QElectroTech's use of this KDE-derived code does not imply that QElectroTech
is endorsed by, affiliated with, or distributed by KDE e.V. or the KDE
project.
